{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-EXERCISE-255YL","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-HINT-255YL-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 255Yl","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-SEG-255YL","semantic_anchor":"255Yl","source_anchor":"255Yl","source_line_start":1110,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"75fcfb595e65e88bb058ee218b8d714048b71ad68674bc5c537ad97ccdab6762","source_text":"set $p'=p/(p-1)$, etc.;  $f_1=f^{p/q'}$,\n$g_1=g^{q/p'}$, $h=(f^p\\times g^q)^{1/r}$.   Use 244Xc to see that\n$\\|f_1\\times g_1\\|_{r'}\\le\\|f_1\\|_{q'}\\|g_1\\|_{p'}$, so that\n$\\int f_1\\times g_1\\times h\\le\\|f_1\\|_{q'}\\|g_1\\|_{p'}\\|h\\|_r$.","target_line_start":1110,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"44d9431d5d44d32e4d0fb043db8b3fb4e778c0121c3e6491a5f1b406eb9b7f24","target_text":"tetapkan $p'=p/(p-1)$, dan seterusnya;  $f_1=f^{p/q'}$,\n$g_1=g^{q/p'}$, $h=(f^p\\times g^q)^{1/r}$.   Gunakan 244Xc untuk melihat bahwa\n$\\|f_1\\times g_1\\|_{r'}\\le\\|f_1\\|_{q'}\\|g_1\\|_{p'}$, sehingga\n$\\int f_1\\times g_1\\times h\\le\\|f_1\\|_{q'}\\|g_1\\|_{p'}\\|h\\|_r$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255"}
{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-EXERCISE-255YL","hint_ordinal":2,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-HINT-255YL-02","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 255Yl","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255-SEG-255YL","semantic_anchor":"255Yl","source_anchor":"255Yl","source_line_start":1116,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"ab786233733c5a76b26bab929046bbffb0ab601a4700a7259dfc060d36a14513","source_text":"take $f$, $g\\ge 0$.   Use (i) to see that\n$(f*g)(x)^r\\le\\|f\\|_p^{r-p}\\|g\\|_q^{r-q}\\int f(y)^pg(x-y)^qdy$, so that\n$\\|f*g\\|_r^r\\le\\|f\\|_p^{r-p}\\|g\\|_q^{r-q}\\int f(y)^p\\|g\\|_q^qdy$.","target_line_start":1116,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"0d1c03fdf69839ff6c9e348a7e103ae44e37a457689dc2744b7243b003e7fe10","target_text":"ambil $f$, $g\\ge 0$.   Gunakan (i) untuk melihat bahwa\n$(f*g)(x)^r\\le\\|f\\|_p^{r-p}\\|g\\|_q^{r-q}\\int f(y)^pg(x-y)^qdy$, sehingga\n$\\|f*g\\|_r^r\\le\\|f\\|_p^{r-p}\\|g\\|_q^{r-q}\\int f(y)^p\\|g\\|_q^qdy$.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S255"}
